  "notes": "Implements the smallest fixture-only published-language review profile derived from Pass 20, Pass 18, and DDD context-mapping recommendations. The validator is split into bounded governance modules under the existing tools responsibility root, references the existing cross-domain seam projection rather than creating a second context-map authority, and creates no API, schema-consumer, policy, adoption, release, deployment, publication, or public-use authority. Follow-up repair makes the tracked compatibility entry point directly executable from a clean checkout and adds a subprocess regression test; it does not change profile semantics or authority."
